   "detailed_description": "<h1>Marvel Rivals Season 10.5: Update Overview</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/4e2975bad000396909e208aa7ba5116c.avif?t=1792140776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras_big/4e2975bad000396909e208aa7ba5116c.avif?t=1792140776 width=1560 height=1062 /></span></p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/7b14c698e3cae345068fc2496c6ea627.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/7b14c698e3cae345068fc2496c6ea627.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/7b14c698e3cae345068fc2496c6ea627.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《漫威爭鋒》是一款超級英雄PvP團隊射擊遊戲。你可以從豐富多樣的超級英雄和反派陣容中，挑選心儀的角色，組成全明星隊伍，在漫威多元宇宙各種充滿特色的地圖上，利用獨特的超能力來一場精彩的激戰。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>深度且多樣的漫威陣容</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可以從《復仇者聯盟》、《星際異攻隊》、《X戰警》等漫威多重宇宙系列中，選擇擁有超高人氣、粉絲最愛的漫威超級英雄或反派進行戰鬥。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/1be995dac6209fcc82602a115764654c.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/1be995dac6209fcc82602a115764654c.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/1be995dac6209fcc82602a115764654c.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>快速又有趣的6v6動作體驗，與不斷變化的遊戲動態</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >細緻的場景、快節奏的遊戲玩法、不斷變換的戰場，你在《漫威爭鋒》中永遠不會感到無聊！成為擁有不可思議能力的超級英雄或反派來進行戰鬥，使用你的力量、瞬間將戰場變得刺激有趣！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/8ec4dc05a3bf2df290124c12824b22b7.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/8ec4dc05a3bf2df290124c12824b22b7.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/8ec4dc05a3bf2df290124c12824b22b7.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>英雄的動態合作技能</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >有趣的英雄角色組合，引燃令人驚訝的合作技能效果！釋放合作技能的超能力，贏得戰略優勢並扭轉戰局。你將能夠化身浣熊火箭，站在格魯特背上對敵人進行猛烈攻擊；或是成為浩克，釋放伽瑪能源為鋼鐵人的反應爐充電。以超能力喚起強大的戰鬥力，一起奪得勝利先機！還有更多精彩內容，都在等著玩家來發現！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/90fdb5ea1bab4a9c2b96106ff8da1786.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/90fdb5ea1bab4a9c2b96106ff8da1786.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/90fdb5ea1bab4a9c2b96106ff8da1786.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>可破壞的地圖場景</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >開闢勝利之路！玩家將在經典的漫威世界場景中戰鬥，橫跨各種可破壞的地圖環境。從阿斯嘉到2099年的東京，使用超能力就能改變這些環境、重新塑造地形，並在戰場上創造戰略優勢！玩家可以尋找掩體來躲避攻擊，或使用臨時武器對敵人發動攻勢。在遊戲中，將有無數種利用環境來贏得勝利的方式！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/29f2b96912254738fe25502020fa8ef7.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/29f2b96912254738fe25502020fa8ef7.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/29f2b96912254738fe25502020fa8ef7.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>不斷發展的漫威宇宙和豐富的預備版本</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >漫威的多重宇宙，帶來的是無盡的可能性！每個季度的大型更新，都會有新的超級英雄加入戰場，並推出充滿挑戰性的多樣化地圖！解鎖新內容以實現各種遊戲策略，同時在冒險的團隊戰鬥中體驗到驚險刺激的戰鬥與無限的可能性。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/6dd8472b5c36421702cd90af0742a75a.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/6dd8472b5c36421702cd90af0742a75a.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/6dd8472b5c36421702cd90af0742a75a.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※《漫威爭鋒》依遊戲軟體分級管理辦法分類為輔導級12+。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※本應用遊戲情節涉及暴力、不當言語。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※本應用遊戲為免費使用，內另有提供購買虛擬遊戲幣、物品等付費服務。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※請依個人興趣、能力、進行體驗，請注意遊戲時間，避免沉迷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >台灣遊戲代理：龍邑股份有限公司</p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/7b14c698e3cae345068fc2496c6ea627.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/7b14c698e3cae345068fc2496c6ea627.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/7b14c698e3cae345068fc2496c6ea627.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《漫威爭鋒》是一款超級英雄PvP團隊射擊遊戲。你可以從豐富多樣的超級英雄和反派陣容中，挑選心儀的角色，組成全明星隊伍，在漫威多元宇宙各種充滿特色的地圖上，利用獨特的超能力來一場精彩的激戰。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>深度且多樣的漫威陣容</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可以從《復仇者聯盟》、《星際異攻隊》、《X戰警》等漫威多重宇宙系列中，選擇擁有超高人氣、粉絲最愛的漫威超級英雄或反派進行戰鬥。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/1be995dac6209fcc82602a115764654c.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/1be995dac6209fcc82602a115764654c.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/1be995dac6209fcc82602a115764654c.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>快速又有趣的6v6動作體驗，與不斷變化的遊戲動態</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >細緻的場景、快節奏的遊戲玩法、不斷變換的戰場，你在《漫威爭鋒》中永遠不會感到無聊！成為擁有不可思議能力的超級英雄或反派來進行戰鬥，使用你的力量、瞬間將戰場變得刺激有趣！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/8ec4dc05a3bf2df290124