ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/29f2b96912254738fe25502020fa8ef7.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>不斷發展的漫威宇宙和豐富的預備版本</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >漫威的多重宇宙，帶來的是無盡的可能性！每個季度的大型更新，都會有新的超級英雄加入戰場，並推出充滿挑戰性的多樣化地圖！解鎖新內容以實現各種遊戲策略，同時在冒險的團隊戰鬥中體驗到驚險刺激的戰鬥與無限的可能性。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/6dd8472b5c36421702cd90af0742a75a.poster.avif?t=1792140776\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/6dd8472b5c36421702cd90af0742a75a.webm?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/6dd8472b5c36421702cd90af0742a75a.mp4?t=1792140776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※《漫威爭鋒》依遊戲軟體分級管理辦法分類為輔導級12+。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※本應用遊戲情節涉及暴力、不當言語。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※本應用遊戲為免費使用，內另有提供購買虛擬遊戲幣、物品等付費服務。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※請依個人興趣、能力、進行體驗，請注意遊戲時間，避免沉迷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >台灣遊戲代理：龍邑股份有限公司</p>",
